        "mission_intent": "We need to stand up an automated compliance-scanning and reporting capability aligned with our ISCM program requirements. The goal is to have our vulnerability scanners, configuration-compliance checkers, and patch-management tools feeding their results into a centralized management console using standardized data formats so we can produce unified security metrics dashboards for leadership. Please ensure the solution covers automated vulnerability scanning with appropriate remediation actions, configuration baselining against approved security checklists, and standardized metric collection and reporting. Any tool that modifies device configurations or applies patches automatically must have its changes validated in a non-production environment before deployment to operational systems. I'd like the team to evaluate both proprietary and standards-based integration options and recommend which protocols and specifications give us the best interoperability across our existing toolset. We need a phased rollout plan with the first capability delivered by end of quarter, and I want weekly status updates once implementation begins. Please coordinate with the infrastructure and vulnerability management teams to confirm tool compatibility and data-exchange requirements.",
